Third-party documents in tests/corpus/vendor
============================================

Every file below is used unmodified and renamed for legibility. tests/corpus/manifest.json records,
for each one, the URL it was retrieved from, the date, and the SHA-256 of the bytes as published.
Only licences that ask for nothing beyond attribution are accepted here (docs/adr/0023); how the
files were found and checked is in docs/corpus-sources.md.

Fonts embedded in these documents remain the property of their foundries and are distributed only
inside the documents, under the embedding permission each font grants.

